flowchart TD
    start["Start here: integrated qualification proposal"]:::start
    subjects["Pin source, builds, host, units and case manifest"]
    missing["Missing subject, queue bound or other required evidence"]
    hold["Profile unavailable; no execution request"]
    decision["Explicit reviewed mechanism execution decision"]
    mechanism["13 mechanism cases: L1-L5 and S1"]
    dependency["External producer guards and actual exec floor"]
    evidence["Separate source, finite results and unknowns"]
    scope["Separate native scope review and execution decision"]
    native["Native service bounds and complete useful workload"]
    complete["Complete profile design and whole-design review"]
    implement["Planning and implementation"]
    controls["Later R and S2-S6 coordinator controls"]
    consume["Reviewed downstream adoption"]
